      "mergeID": "62265c37920a00458b40660a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I want to disable strangers' (non-firends')　physics bones as keeping friends' are enabled, for performance and aesthetic reasons.\nThis build lacks of limiting physics bones usage feature. Limiting them is vital to reduce cost of calculation and increase FPS in a crowded instance. I request adding physics bones toggle next to current safety shield settings (Voice, Avatar, ... , Custom Animation). This per-User-Rank basis limitation would be better than bones counting basis (current dynamic bones limitation), because I don't like current method blocks my own or my friends' avatars dynamic bones.\n\nPhysics BonesをシェーダーみたいにSafetyから制限できる設定がほしいです。（大人数インスタンスで他人のボーンの計算を飛ばして負荷軽減しつつ、フレンドのボーンが動くのを見たいため）",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1181] [Request] Add Physics Bones toggles to safety shield menu",
